1
00:00:00,122 --> 00:00:02,412
(Penny:)Sheldon, it's just a box of rhinestones.

2
00:00:02,582 --> 00:00:05,292
(Sheldon:)Contents are irrelevant.
A legal bailment has been created.

3
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:07,170
(Sheldon:)Does that mean nothing to you?

4
00:00:07,963 --> 00:00:09,843
(Penny:)It means nothing to anybody.

5
00:00:11,049 --> 00:00:13,339
(Penny:)- Let me show you what I'm doing.
- Bailment...

6
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:15,550
(Sheldon:)...describes a relationship
in common law...

7
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:18,810
(Sheldon:)...where a physical possession
of personal property, or chattels...

8
00:00:18,974 --> 00:00:22,564
...is transferred from one person, the bailer,
to another person, the bailee.

9
00:00:22,727 --> 00:00:24,977
(Penny:)Yeah, yeah. Look, look.
I started a business.

10
00:00:26,398 --> 00:00:28,988
(Sheldon:)Obviously not a cleaning business.

11
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:32,990
(Penny:)No. I'm making flower barrettes. See?

12
00:00:33,155 --> 00:00:37,155
(Penny:)I call them Penny Blossoms. I made one
for myself. All the girls at work wanted one.

13
00:00:37,325 --> 00:00:40,665
(Penny:)I showed some to this lady who
runs a shop. She sells cards and jewelry.

14
00:00:40,829 --> 00:00:45,419
(Penny:)She wanted to sell them, I said okay,
and in one week, I made a $156.

15
00:00:45,584 --> 00:00:48,504
(Sheldon:)Good for you. Sign here.

16
00:00:50,338 --> 00:00:54,258
(Penny:)Sheldon, don't you get it? If this takes off,
I won't have to be a waitress anymore.

17
00:00:54,843 --> 00:00:57,803
(Sheldon:)But then who will bring me
my cheeseburger on Tuesday nights?

18
00:00:58,263 --> 00:00:59,473
Another waitress?

